{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《愛．回家之開心速遞》即將迎來大結局，早前一班演員合體拍攝煞科戲，小編亦趁機抓緊機會，拍攝了一輯絕密幕後花絮，跟大家公開《愛·回家》這個大家庭私下感情到底有幾好。<br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"花絮2 done - 截图2\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/b9509c731e8d4314a6834ea1765d9040/snapshots/1e98bc56bba54b88ab43dce65c8cb739-00002.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 花絮2 done 的第2张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">「龔燁」張景淳在現場貼心為每一位夥伴送上一紮鮮花，暖心舉動讓不少工作人員直呼感動。 作為劇集的靈魂人物，「熊樹根」劉丹成為眾人爭相合照與「圍咀」的目標，大家紛紛上前親吻其面珠，現場洋溢着無比溫馨的氛圍。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-17h30m53s472.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026aUUOhEmo8L1784865304.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-17h30m53s472.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"花絮2 done - 截图8\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/b9509c731e8d4314a6834ea1765d9040/snapshots/1e98bc56bba54b88ab43dce65c8cb739-00008.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 花絮2 done 的第8张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">除了歡樂的慶祝畫面，現場亦不乏動人淚點。向來重情重義的「熊若水」呂慧儀，在告別時刻難掩心中的不捨與感性，忍不住緊緊攬着「David」湯盈盈爆喊，真情流露的感人場面令在場眾人動容。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-17h31m00s544.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026KNNmkX1lmE1784865329.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-17h31m00s544.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-17h31m26s512.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026jVG7sugTHN1784865354.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-22-17h31m26s512.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T04:20:34.576634+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}